Hatimaye, tunachukua jumla kubwa zaidi ya kuongezeka na kupungua kwa kila nafasi kwenye mlolongo na kuichukua kama jumla ya juu zaidi ya mlolongo wa bi-tonic.

```python
def max_biotonic_sum(arr):
    n = len(arr)
    increase = [x for x in arr]
    decrease = [x for x in arr]

    for i in range(1, n):
        for j in range(i):
            if arr[i] > arr[j]:
                increase[i] = max(increase[i], increase[j] + arr[i])

    for i in range(n-2, -1, -1):
        for j in range(n-1, i, -1):
            if arr[i] > arr[j]:
                decrease[i] = max(decrease[i], decrease[j] + arr[i])

    max_sum = 0
    for i in range(n):
        max_sum = max(max_sum, increase[i], decrease[i])

    return max_sum
```

