Kwanza, tunahitaji kuelewa dhana ya inversion. Inversion hutokea wakati vipengele viwili vya tuple vinapokuwa katika mpangilio usio sahihi, yaani, kiashiria cha kwanza ni kikubwa kuliko kiashiria cha pili. 

Sasa, hebu tuzingatie jinsi ya kutekeleza chaguo hili la kukokotoa. Tunaweza kutumia mbinu ya moja kwa moja, ambapo tunalinganisha kila jozi ya vipengele katika kila tuple na kuhesabu idadi ya inversions.

```python
def inversion_tuple(orodha):
    inversions = 0
    for tup in orodha:
        for i in range(len(tup)):
            for j in range(i+1, len(tup)):
                if tup[i] > tup[j]:
                    inversions += 1
    return inversions
```

Mbinu hii itafanya kazi vizuri kwa orodha ndogo za tuples, lakini inaweza kuwa polepole kwa orodha kubwa. Ili kuboresha utendakazi, tunaweza kuzingatia kutumia algorithm ya utaratibu wa haraka zaidi, kama vile algorithm ya quicksort, ambayo inaweza kuhesabu inversions wakati wa kufanya utaratibu.

```python
def inversion_tuple_haraka(orodha):
    inversions = 0
    def quicksort(arr):
        nonlocal inversions
        if len(arr) <= 1:
            return arr
        pivot = arr[len(arr) // 2]
        left = [x for x in arr if x < pivot]
        middle = [x for x in arr if x == pivot]
        right = [x for x in arr if x > pivot]
        inversions += len(left) * len(right)
        return quicksort(left) + middle + quicksort(right)
    for tup in orodha:
        quicksort(list(tup))
    return inversions
```

